# Production build settings are not kept in the repo.
# - GitHub Pages: repository variables VITE_SUPABASE_URL, VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   and VITE_THEME_LOCK (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables).
# - Local `pnpm build`: put the same keys in apps/web/.env.production.local (git-ignored).
